quot;:&quot;ConceptText&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:true}" await-children>白菜帮斜切薄片，嫩叶撕大块分次下锅。用一汤匙<span class="concept-term"><a class="concept-trigger" data-concept-id="black-vinegar" href="/zh/wiki/browse/seasonings/#concept-black-vinegar" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false">香醋</a></span>沿锅边烹一下，白菜帮还脆，叶子已经挂上酸香的汁。<!--astro:end--></astro-island></p><dl class="recipe-meta"><div><dt>备料</dt><dd>8 分钟</dd></div><div><dt>烹饪</dt><dd>5 分钟</dd></div><div><dt>餐桌份量</dt><dd>2 人份配菜</dd></div></dl></div><figure class="hero-visual"><img src="/images/recipes/hot-and-sour-napa-cabbage--hero-1200.webp" srcset="/images/recipes/responsive/hot-and-sour-napa-cabbage-240.webp 240w, /images/recipes/responsive/hot-and-sour-napa-cabbage-400.webp 400w, /images/recipes/hot-and-sour-napa-cabbage--hero-600.webp 600w, /images/recipes/responsive/hot-and-sour-napa-cabbage-800.webp 800w, /images/recipes/hot-and-sour-napa-cabbage--hero-1200.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 760px) min(calc(100vw - 2.4rem), 540px), (max-width: 1264px) calc(47.619vw - 3.333rem), 549px" alt="醋溜白菜" width="1200" height="800" fetchpriority="high"></figure><aside class="print-only recipe-print-source" data-pagefind-ignore><a href="https://chineserecipes.xyz/zh/recipes/hot-and-sour-napa-cabbage/?via=recipe-print" rel="nofollow"><span aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 45 45"><rect fill="white" width="45" height="45"/><path fill="black" d="M4,4h1v1h-1zM5,4h1v1h-1zM6,4h1v1h-1zM7,4h1v1h-1zM8,4h1v1h-1zM9,4h1v1h-1zM10,4h1v1h-1zM14,4h1v1h-1zM17,4h1v1h-1zM18,4h1v1h-1zM19,4h1v1h-1zM20,4h1v1h-1zM21,4h1v1h-1zM23,4h1v1h-1zM24,4h1v1h-1zM27,4h1v1h-1zM32,4h1v1h-1zM34,4h1v1h-1zM35,4h1v1h-1zM36,4h1v1h-1zM37,4h1v1h-1zM38,4h1v1h-1zM39,4h1v1h-1zM40,4h1v1h-1zM4,5h1v1h-1zM10,5h1v1h-1zM17,5h1v1h-1zM22,5h1v1h-1zM25,5h1v1h-1zM29,5h1v1h-1zM31,5h1v1h-1zM32,5h1v1h-1zM34,5h1v1h-1zM40,5h1v1h-1zM4,6h1v1h-1zM6,6h1v1h-1zM7,6h1v1h-1zM8,6h1v1h-1zM10,6h1v1h-1zM12,6h1v1h-1zM13,6h1v1h-1zM14,6h1v1h-1zM15,6h1v1h-1zM17,6h1v1h-1zM